+// go-moonscript patch: LuaJIT's FFI numerals (1LL, 1ULL, 1i) in
+// DialectLuaJIT. They are cdata, which the VM doesn't have: they parse, as
+// with luajit, and evaluating one is an error (luajit evaluates them to
